sequenceDiagram
    actor Member
    actor Librarian
    participant Page as Web page
    participant Controller as CirculationController
    participant Service as CirculationService
    participant Repositories as JPA repositories
    participant DB as Relational database

    Member->>Page: Submit borrowing request
    Page->>Controller: POST /books/{id}/requests
    Controller->>Service: submitRequest(username, bookId, note)
    Service->>Repositories: Verify member, active title and duplicate request
    Repositories->>DB: Read request data
    Service->>Repositories: Save PENDING request
    Repositories->>DB: Insert request

    Librarian->>Page: Approve request
    Page->>Controller: POST /circulation/requests/{id}/approve
    Controller->>Service: approveRequest(requestId)
    Service->>Repositories: Lock request/member/copy and check eligibility
    Repositories->>DB: Read and lock records
    Service->>Repositories: Save loan and mark request approved
    Repositories->>DB: Commit transaction

    Member->>Page: Reserve unavailable title
    Page->>Controller: POST /books/{id}/reservations
    Controller->>Service: submitReservation(username, bookId)
    Service->>Repositories: Check eligibility and append FIFO reservation
    Repositories->>DB: Save WAITING reservation

    Librarian->>Page: Record return
    Page->>Controller: POST /circulation/loans/{id}/return
    Controller->>Service: returnLoan(loanId)
    Service->>Repositories: Record return and capped fine
    Service->>Repositories: Assign returned copy to earliest eligible reservation
    Repositories->>DB: Commit return, fine and reservation updates

    Member->>Page: Claim ready reservation within 48 hours
    Page->>Controller: POST /reservations/{id}/claim
    Controller->>Service: claimReservation(reservationId, username)
    Service->>Repositories: Recheck member limits and create loan
    Repositories->>DB: Mark reservation fulfilled and copy ON_LOAN

    Librarian->>Page: Open circulation report
    Page->>Controller: GET /circulation/loans
    Controller->>Service: mostBorrowedTitles()
    Service->>Repositories: Find top five titles by loan count
    Repositories->>DB: Group loans by title and order by count
    DB-->>Repositories: Ranked title, author and count rows
    Repositories-->>Service: At most five popularity summaries
    Service-->>Controller: Popular titles
    Controller-->>Page: Render report with popularity summary
